<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῠρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to cover with silver,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Dialex.</u>
					2.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.899.4
				</span></i>
			: —
				Pass.
			, <i>to be silvered, silver-plated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύπος ἠργυρωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Mon.</u>
					469
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρούμενα ἢ ἐνηργυρωμένα
				σκεύη</span> Timae.Astr. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.97.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. of
			persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρωθέντες σὺν οἰνηραῖς
				φιάλαις</span>
			<i>rewarded with silver</i> wine-cups, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.43
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδαὶ ἀργυρωθεῖσαι
			πρόσωπα</span> songs <i>with silvered</i> brow, i.e.
				<i>mercenary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>I.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
